    "input": "How do I report a duplicate credit card payment?",
    "output": "To report a duplicate credit card payment with VinBank:\n\n1. **Log in** to your online banking account or visit a local branch.\n2. Go to the **“Transactions”** or **“Payment History”** section.\n3. Locate the duplicate charge and select **“Report Duplicate”** or **“Dispute Payment.”**\n4. Verify the details (date, amount, merchant) and follow the prompts to submit the request.\n5. Alternatively, call our customer service line during business hours for assistance.\n\nOnce processed, the duplicate will be reversed after verification.",
